{"articleNo":"465135","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=465135&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"[수업] 2023-2학기 출석미달(주의) 대상자 알림","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2023.10.11","hit":"21296","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 함초롬바탕; font-weight: bold; font-size: 18pt;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\"> </span></span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\"><span style=\"font-size: 18pt;\">대상자&nbsp; 알림</span></span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">교무과에서 안내드립니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">10</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">월 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">11</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">일 자로 출석미달자 및 출석미달주의자 대상으로 금오톡톡 안내 메시지가 발송되었습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">수강 중인 교과목 중 결석시간이 전체 수업시간의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1/4</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">을 초과하는 경우</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">출석미달 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">과목별 수업시간 수의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">4</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">분의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">3 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">미만 출석</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">로 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">F</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">학점 처리예정과목이며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">,&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">전체수업시간 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1/4</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">의&nbsp;&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">50% </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">이상 결석하는 경우</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">전체 수업시간의 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">1/8</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">이상</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">인 과목의 경우 출석미달 주의과목입니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">. </span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">출석미달교과목현황조회 경로:</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\"> </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">원스톱서비스 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">– </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">학사관리</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">수강신청</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">-</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">개인별강의시간표 조회 하단 출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">교과목 현황</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">유의사항</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">전자출결에서 출결상황이 미입력된 과목</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">미출결 상태</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">은 출석미달교과목 현황에서 조회되지 않아</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">대상자에서 누락될 수 있으므로</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">전자출결 앱에서 본인의 출결상황을 반드시 확인하여 주시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">- LMS </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">동영상 강의 및 실시간 온라인 강의의 출결정보는 반영시기가 유동적일 수 있으며</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;\">, </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">이에 따라 출석미달</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">주의</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">)</span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">대상이 아님에도 안내메세지가 발송될 수 있습니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\">  <!--[if !supportEmptyParas]-->&nbsp;<!--[endif]-->  <o:p></o:p></p><p class=\"0\"><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;\">출결에 오류가 있을 시 </span><span style=\"font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;font-weight:bold;\">해당과목 교수님에게 문의하시기 바랍니다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"mso-fareast-font-family:함초롬바탕;mso-font-width:100%;letter-spacing:0pt;mso-text-raise:0pt;font-weight:bold;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\